OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTurning
OL,6,Fdrier and brighter this evening as
OL,7,Frain clears east. Winds are also
OL,8,Fexpected to ease which will allow for
OL,9,Fa chilly night with clear spells and a
OL,10,Frural grass frost.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA dry day on Monday with light
OL,13,Fwinds and prolonged spells of
OL,14,Fsunshine. Chilly at first, but warm in
OL,15,Fthe afternoon. Sunshine turning hazy
OL,16,Fat times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
